Source: libpcapng
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Seb Tricaud <sebastien.tricaud@proton.me>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake (>= 3.20), ninja-build
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/stricaud/libpcapng
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libpcapng1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: pcapng file format library
 libpcapng is a C library for reading and writing pcapng capture files.
 It supports pcapng block types (SHB, IDB, EPB, SPB, custom blocks),
 protocol dissection, IP/TCP reassembly, and live packet capture.

Package: libpcapng-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: libpcapng1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: pcapng library — development files
 Headers, static library, and pkg-config file for building against libpcapng.

Package: pcapsh
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: interactive pcapng shell and packet crafter
 pcapsh is a scripting shell for generating and replaying pcapng traffic.
 It ships with .posa protocol definition files for common network protocols
 and supports live capture, dissection, and pcapng file generation.
